      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이건 용족의 품격에 맞지 않는군. 뭐 아무래도 좋나!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "これじゃ下手に出すぎか…ま、いっか！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 19,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "문을 박살낼 기세로… 아니.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ドアをぶっ壊す勢いで…いや",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 20,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "문을 조금 부수며 박차고 들어온 것은…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ドアを少し壊しながら入ってきたのは…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 21,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "음. 붉은 머리에 멋들어진 뿔이 달린 소녀다. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "うん、赤い髪におしゃれな角がついた少女だ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 22,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "뿔…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "角…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 23,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "EmotionEffect": "FUN",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이 몸 등장!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "わがはい、ご登場！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 24,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이곳이 <color=#F7BE45>여정</color>을 담당할 단장이 묵고 있다는 숙소인가?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ここが<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>団長が泊っている宿なのか？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 25,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "잠시 실례하겠다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "ちょいと失礼する！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 26,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "문을 부수기 전에 인사를 먼저 해…",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "扉を壊す前に挨拶をしなさい…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 27,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "순서가 거꾸로잖아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "順序がでたらめだな……",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 28,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "아, 그러냐? 하하하! 인간들은 참 귀찮게 사는구만.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "そうなのか？アハハ！人間はややこしいのだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 29,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그럼 내 소개 먼저 하도록 하지!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "では、わがはいの紹介から始めよう！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 30,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "은근슬쩍 넘어가려 해도 소용없다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "さりげなく話題を切り替えても無駄だ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 31,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "이건 꼭 배상 요청을 할 거다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "修理費は必ず請求してやる。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 32,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SPECIAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "위대한 용족의 일원이자… <color=#F7BE45>별의 구원자</color>와 초대 구원단의 의복을 재단한 <color=#F7BE45>대재단사</color> 마리사 벨라르미니의 후예.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "偉大なる竜族の一員であり…<color=#F7BE45>「星の救援者」</color>やその仲間の衣服を作った<color=#F7BE45>「大仕立屋」</color>マリサ・ベラルミニの末裔。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_TOUCH",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그리고 언젠가 <color=#F7BE45>대재단사</color>가 될, 이 몸의 이름은 스칼렛 벨라르미니!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "いずれは<color=#F7BE45>「大仕立屋」</color>になる、わがはいの名はスカーレット・ベラルミニ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "<color=#F7BE45>대재단사</color>가 남긴 흔적을 쫓아 인간 세상을 모험하던 중, <color=#F7BE45>여정</color>의 초대장을 받아 이렇게 찾아오게 되었느니라!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "<color=#F7BE45>「大仕立屋」</color>の跡を追い、人間世界を旅していると<color=#F7BE45>「救援の旅」</color>の招待状をもらったので、来た！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 35,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "보아하니 네가 단장이로군! 반갑다!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "見たところ、お主が団長だな！よろしくなのだ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 36,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "JumpAnchorData": [
        {
          "Uid": 1,
          "JumpAnchorStringId_KOR": "그, 그래.",
          "JumpAnchorStringId_JPN": "そ、そうか…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Uid": 37,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "스칼렛은 내 손을 잡고 힘차게 흔들어 댔다. ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "スカーレットはこちらの手を握り、激しく上下に揺さぶった。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 38,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "NORMAL",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그나저나 조금 늦은 건 미안하게 생각한다.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "少し遅刻したのは悪かったと思うぞ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 39,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "분명히 알람을 맞춰 놓고 잠들었는데, 일어나보니까 자명종이 박살 나 있더군!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "確かアラームをかけておいたのに、起きてみると時計が壊れていたのだ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 40,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "분명 어떤 못된 녀석이 장난을 친 모양이지.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "きっと悪い奴にイタズラされたのだな。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 41,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "CameraOffset": "ONE_3",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "FA",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "EmotionEffect": "UPSET",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "잡히면 혼쭐을 내줘야겠어!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "捕まえたら懲らしめてやるぞ！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 42,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "음… 근데 오늘따라 왜 이렇게 주먹이 아프지? ",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "しかし、今日はなんか拳が痛いのだ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 43,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_MAID_SCISSORS",
      "UnitMotion": "USN_UI_REST_START",
      "EmotionEffect": "THINK",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "어제 캔들 스퀘어에서 청소를 너무 열심히 했나…?",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "昨日キャンドル・スクエアで掃除を頑張りすぎたせいか…？",
      "TalkTime": 0.03
    },
    {
      "Uid": 44,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "CameraOffset": "TWIN_6",
      "CameraOffsetTime": "NR",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "…그냥 네가 잠결에 부순 거잖아.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "…単にお前が夢うつつに壊したんだろう、それ。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "AutoHighlight": "OFF"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 45,
      "ContentsTag": "DEV_OPEN",
      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_SCISSORS_01",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "그런데 잠깐, 캔들 스퀘어…?",
